  "prefLabel": "Rev 404.02 Residency Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 404.02 Residency Requirements. The applicant shall have been a New Hampshire resident for at least one year preceding April 1 in the tax year in which the veterans’ tax credit is claimed.\n\nSource. #5911, eff 10-14-94; ss by #7410, eff 11-23-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16",
